{"title":"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Telescoping)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Telescoping)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(I_did_too_many_FE&#39;s)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (I did too many FE's)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Easier_Explicit)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Easier Explicit)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/0/cb07e848f9188a9fd706d99ab6513a7d949c48a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"35\" height=\"20\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b1171ce641826e9aca894162f9c15a57f6b46e09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/1/d81b3bfe3ff0aeeeacb34d300ff9d7630bd2d1c5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5^{(a_{n + 1} - a_n)} - 1 = \\frac{1}{n + \\frac{2}{3}}\\]\" width=\"176\" height=\"43\" />\nfor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/8/578cf6c5b8058f6f8e6369416da6dcaf73f8fc01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> be the least integer greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/a/bea4d576937a04ec200b1037fc8ee33e8f744cb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The best way to solve this problem is to get the iterated part out of the exponent:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/d/83dead807fbda0d002949edbcc2c4dc658cc3cc3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5^{(a_{n + 1} - a_n)} = \\frac {1}{n + \\frac {2}{3}} + 1\\]\" width=\"177\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/2/b12143dfb49fc4d354f9f7d04c207e216e273598.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5^{(a_{n + 1} - a_n)} = \\frac {n + \\frac {5}{3}}{n + \\frac {2}{3}}\\]\" width=\"145\" height=\"47\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2c016a16c6306dd03125b535bb2a994f21a6c7c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5^{(a_{n + 1} - a_n)} = \\frac {3n + 5}{3n + 2}\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/7/1f7b9dd9bc69ad1dacbe9d6bda96cec3c1ef7c68.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{n + 1} - a_n = \\log_5{\\left(\\frac {3n + 5}{3n + 2}\\right)}\\]\" width=\"212\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d4c2ec3f3c49ea4bcc502c25f6002485d4b4fa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{n + 1} - a_n = \\log_5{(3n + 5)} - \\log_5{(3n + 2)}\\]\" width=\"319\" height=\"18\" />\nPlug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/c/2ccb96c3451d351085035d873b42734c582c37c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 1, 2, 3, 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"16\" /> to see the first few terms of the sequence: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/8/4a89100b34f9f3e24be5147ec8db483a211f6c1b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_5{5},\\log_5{8}, \\log_5{11}, \\log_5{14}.\\]\" width=\"217\" height=\"17\" /> We notice that the terms  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/c/76cc80b85f74ad0a0f0f54877eb02956da00dfae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5, 8, 11, 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" /> are in arithmetic progression. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d3d4168398b4964361e1a05c220742b00bbf14f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = 1 = \\log_5{5} = \\log_5{(3(1) + 2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"252\" height=\"18\" />, we can easily use induction to show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93662491c009c7b5c121bc96fd2a9fb581371d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n = \\log_5{(3n + 2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"18\" />. So now we only need to find the next value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> that makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/3/443306a00030bd0ab45e3a9c58fc44caf96f6914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_5{(3n + 2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" /> an integer. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/3/f239b9040629fd77f71ffd3a201632c80ffa56c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3n + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> must be a power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. We test <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd2c214fe355cff53f5df66998eff2a8c507be8f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3n + 2 = 25\\]\" width=\"92\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/9/df919830eba0bb5ea8b65456fbbf31df25a727b8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3n = 23\\]\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" /> This has no integral solutions, so we try <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/2/b829a6f0810a25e9ca9f85d690f2bafd0f2c1773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2cd83ce3666d32d3f20543e9c1a055a2e7a4103.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3n + 2 = 125\\]\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/5/9358b205bc6c0a18e0a042adc3ad937a1d02a4e8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3n = 123\\]\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/e/cbe61593c6c18016e2ee0a442eff90becb2e62a0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n = \\boxed{041}\\]\" width=\"73\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Telescoping.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Telescoping)\">Solution 2 (Telescoping)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Telescoping)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We notice that by multiplying the equation from an arbitrary <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1a2b6b7c193f9ba2b2134a59f1da5addcfbc98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> all the way to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/0/1b0b996ee2fb8341f322887efd31c5382e543825.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5^{a_n-a_1}=\\dfrac{n+\\tfrac23}{1+\\tfrac23}\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"47\" />\nThis simplifies to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/e/f8e5574565bc12e4564a61a1397568b80d3dd245.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5^{a_n}=3n+2.\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" />\nWe can now test powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> - that gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, which is useless.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> - that gives a non-integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/2/b829a6f0810a25e9ca9f85d690f2bafd0f2c1773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> - that gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/8/738a6c1ae40a68558340aaaa9b0ea35f8effde57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=\\boxed{41}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"66\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>-integralarefun\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28I_did_too_many_FE.27s.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(I_did_too_many_FE's)\">Solution 3 (I did too many FE's)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (I did too many FE&#39;s)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The given recursion is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/a/7ead75d384901c68c2093ce1d13e2c3bf28264e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5^{a_{n+1}}}{3(n+1)+2}=\\frac{5^{a_n}}{3n+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"182\" height=\"43\" />. By a simple inductive argument, the value <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/9/229ca79f9341ba41315972dd9e4028149951d0f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5^{a_k}}{3k+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"56\" height=\"40\" /> is constant for all naturals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />. In particular, when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/d/5ed8470bc717a49aafe4556c7e2c2e11ddc7b687.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, the expression is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/155fff06a61100e1e72c9fe92b9c4ad0315b7f97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5^{a_k}}{3k+2}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"90\" height=\"40\" /> for all naturals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/8/dc8b13eadf573c5f3b00dfa668ee2a22ebd817f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k=\\log_5(3k+2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"139\" height=\"20\" />, and testing powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/e/37e4a4c2c14064a6272665d3843147cf21ffb2c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=\\boxed{41}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"66\" height=\"25\" /> as the answer, which is when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/4/b0417d0a6260f243a667cc896dd4449d9349ce9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{41}=\\log_5(3\\cdot41+2)=\\log_5(125)=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"296\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Eevee9406\">eevee9406</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Easier_Explicit.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Easier_Explicit)\">Solution 4 (Easier Explicit)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Easier Explicit)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/0/f308d25362edf91e3fe2f2f0174ce63778a92fa5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5^{a_{n+1} - a_n} = \\frac{3n+5}{3n+2}\\]\" width=\"142\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/d/9fd487d7e142243f3a5ff22a1d7200db996fc266.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{n+1} - a_n = \\log_{5}(\\frac{3n+5}{3n+2})\\]\" width=\"199\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/d/b0d34a9479c301efb8a053b547817581bba80067.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{n+1} = \\log_{5}(\\frac{3n+5}{3n+2}) + a_n\\]\" width=\"199\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p>So,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/7/4b77b9529b5f6b9b2390ca2cde4988b738193d24.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{n+1} = \\log_{5}(\\frac{3n+5}{3n+2}) + \\log_{5}(\\frac{3(n-1)+5}{3(n-1)+2}) + \\dots +  \\log_{5}(\\frac{8}{5}) + a_1\\]\" width=\"488\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>in which we see telescopes to \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/b/68bbeb2e288cdd1e125ebe5fe7f3a3553789d315.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{n+1} = \\log_{5}(\\frac{3n+5}{5})\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Now, we must find the smallest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/2/182c33e4053c504de69ba47633012045b5353505.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{5}(\\frac{3n+5}{5}) \\in \\mathbb{Z} \\neq 1, n \\in \\mathbb{Z}^+ \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"267\" height=\"38\" />. We first check <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/8/f781a61cdb108499eca30fc4d49b8fd98b2aa35f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3n+5}{5} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />, but see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is not an integer, so we check <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34377a788d41450689a6af3394d0e5d78bb125e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3n+5}{5} = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"100\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/4/654b7e345fda1ace127e8bd9bbd05eacb7536dd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3n = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed039602eb74edb8a682d582207fac8b89f3ce2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />. The index <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/2/522d2a0cff1cea5a57526bee66d7187cf8d9e83d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = n+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" /> implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/9/1492262ba399a0c57f30adcab2da05dceec0188c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = \\boxed{041}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"75\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I\" title=\"2009 AIME I\">2009 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2009\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of Am